1
00:00:05,805 --> 00:00:10,276
A reader finishes the first part of
the book and agrees with every line.

2
00:00:10,356 --> 00:00:12,124
The witness was not found.

3
00:00:12,204 --> 00:00:14,343
Vividness did not need a viewer.

4
00:00:15,158 --> 00:00:17,864
The next morning someone
says something unkind.

5
00:00:17,944 --> 00:00:20,554
Within a second there
is someone who was hurt,

6
00:00:20,634 --> 00:00:22,402
and someone planning a reply.

7
00:00:22,482 --> 00:00:24,589
Nothing in the argument was false.

8
00:00:24,669 --> 00:00:28,017
It simply never reached the
place where the habit works.

9
00:00:28,829 --> 00:00:33,178
Buddhist traditions call the root
of suffering ignorance, avidyā.

10
00:00:33,258 --> 00:00:36,942
The word is easy to misread
as missing information,

11
00:00:37,022 --> 00:00:38,898
something a teacher could supply.

12
00:00:38,978 --> 00:00:41,058
The ignorance meant here is different.

13
00:00:41,138 --> 00:00:44,442
It is a misrecognition of
what is already present.

14
00:00:44,522 --> 00:00:47,893
Dzogchen calls it ma
rigpa, non-recognition.

15
00:00:47,973 --> 00:00:52,363
The nature of appearing is right
here, and it goes unrecognised.

16
00:00:52,443 --> 00:00:54,550
The remedy is not a new fact.

17
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:56,783
It is a seeing that was overlooked.

18
00:00:57,585 --> 00:01:01,920
If ignorance were a missing belief,
an argument could fill the gap.

19
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,649
If it is a habit of not seeing, an
argument can only change a belief about

20
00:01:06,729 --> 00:01:09,221
the habit. The habit carries on.

21
00:01:10,045 --> 00:01:12,179
Watch an ordinary moment closely.

22
00:01:12,259 --> 00:01:14,190
Something touches the senses.

23
00:01:14,270 --> 00:01:18,647
At once it is arranged into
a seer, a seeing and a seen.

24
00:01:18,727 --> 00:01:22,804
A feeling follows: a pull
towards, or a pulling away.

25
00:01:22,884 --> 00:01:28,008
Then reasoning begins, and it takes that
arrangement as the fact it must deal with.

26
00:01:28,088 --> 00:01:31,908
By the time a thought forms,
the frame is already in place,

27
00:01:31,988 --> 00:01:33,610
and the thought defends it.

28
00:01:34,433 --> 00:01:37,953
So reasoning is not the
source. It arrives late.

29
00:01:38,033 --> 00:01:41,595
This is why someone can argue
skilfully against a self,

30
00:01:41,675 --> 00:01:43,864
and still be wounded by a slight.

31
00:01:43,944 --> 00:01:46,133
The argument happened in one place.

32
00:01:46,213 --> 00:01:47,958
The wound happened in another.

33
00:01:48,765 --> 00:01:51,049
Even real insight gets absorbed.

34
00:01:51,129 --> 00:01:54,541
A reader sees that the one
who hears is not found,

35
00:01:54,621 --> 00:01:56,348
and feels the relief of it.

36
00:01:56,428 --> 00:02:00,967
Soon "there is no self" becomes
a view to hold and defend,

37
00:02:01,047 --> 00:02:03,644
and the one who holds
it is the seer again.

38
00:02:03,724 --> 00:02:05,750
Analysis works the same way.

39
00:02:05,830 --> 00:02:07,616
The question "who is looking?"

40
00:02:07,786 --> 00:02:09,545
already presumes a looker.

41
00:02:10,345 --> 00:02:12,221
Why go on to logic at all, then?

42
00:02:12,301 --> 00:02:16,121
Because the habit is most persuasive
when nothing challenges it.

43
00:02:16,201 --> 00:02:19,151
An argument that shows
the frame is assumed,

44
00:02:19,231 --> 00:02:24,155
not found, gives the seeing something
to rest on when feelings run strong.

45
00:02:24,978 --> 00:02:27,412
The habit is also felt in the body.

46
00:02:27,492 --> 00:02:30,700
When someone feels wronged,
the chest may tighten,

47
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:34,409
the breath shortens, and
attention narrows to a point.

48
00:02:34,489 --> 00:02:38,852
When the frame loosens, the body
may soften and the attention open.

49
00:02:38,932 --> 00:02:42,647
This is something to test,
not to believe in advance.

50
00:02:43,449 --> 00:02:45,787
The habit rests on four supports.

51
00:02:45,867 --> 00:02:48,763
Grammar puts a doer behind every act.

52
00:02:48,843 --> 00:02:52,526
Memory treats remembering
as proof of a rememberer.

53
00:02:52,606 --> 00:02:55,678
Naming turns a useful label into a holder.

54
00:02:55,758 --> 00:03:00,515
Deepest is the need for a ground:
uncertainty feels like falling,

55
00:03:00,595 --> 00:03:03,591
so a floor is looked
for beneath experience.

56
00:03:04,418 --> 00:03:07,015
The first step is not
to fight the pattern,

57
00:03:07,095 --> 00:03:09,325
or to replace it with a better picture.

58
00:03:09,405 --> 00:03:14,107
A new account of a true self beneath
it would only build a second seer.

59
00:03:14,187 --> 00:03:17,142
The first step is to see
the pattern as a pattern.

60
00:03:17,945 --> 00:03:21,968
A thought of "I" arises, and
it is noticed as a thought.

61
00:03:22,048 --> 00:03:27,131
A feeling of being wronged arises, and
it is noticed as tightness and heat.

62
00:03:27,211 --> 00:03:28,630
Nothing is done to it.

63
00:03:29,458 --> 00:03:33,318
The looking is enough to show that the
seer was never standing where the habit

64
00:03:33,398 --> 00:03:34,598
said it stood.

